      "summary": "Evidence summary: 6 validated structured observations; consult observations and conflicts for supported findings.",
      "observations": [
        {
          "category": "mechanics",
          "statement": "The defining system combines poker hands with ability cards: ordinary cards attack or defend, while pairs, straights and other combinations interact with class skills and create a more tactical card-battle rhythm.",
